---@meta
-- Generated by rs3-api-types from https://developer.runescape.com/rs/game/entity/locentity.html;
-- regenerate it with ./gradlew generate rather than editing it.

---An `LocEntity` represents an instance of an LocType that is currently active in the game world.
---
---See LocList for information on how to access `LocEntities`.
---
---Info: An `LocEntity` is a Proxy usertype, which means it is safe to copy and store in your scripts. It cannot,
---however, be used with any persistent storage.
---
---Warning: Use `LocEntity.isValid` to confirm that an entity still exists before trying to access its properties.
---Entities can be removed from the client by the server for various reasons, i.e. due to moving beyond the player view
---distance or being deleted by the server. When an entity is removed it will become invalid, and any copies of this
---usertype should be disposed of. If the same entity is re-created on the client, such as walking back into visibility
---range, then a different new LocEntity will be created.
---
---Information available within an `LocEntity` includes:
---@class LocEntity
---@field isValid boolean (Read-only) Whether this entity still exists. Dispose of this usertype object when invalid.
---@field displayName string (Read-only) The display name of this entity.
---@field config LocType (Read-only) The config used by this entity.
---@field parentConfig LocType (Read-only) The parent config used by this entity, if it is a MultiLoc.
---@field configID integer (Read-only) The ID of the config used by this entity.
---@field parentConfigID integer (Read-only) The ID of the parent config used by this entity, if it is a MultiLoc.
---@field isMultiLoc boolean (Read-only) Whether this entity is a MultiLoc.
---@field position Vector3 (Read-only) The world position of this entity.
---@field coordGrid CoordGrid (Read-only) Returns the CoordGrid tile this entity is currently on.
---@field shapeType LocShapeType (Read-only) The LocShapeType being used by this entity.
---@field rotationType RotationType (Read-only) The 90-degree rotation type being used by this entity.
---@field width integer (Read-only) The width of this entity on the X axis, in grid units. This taken from entity's LocType config after being rotated by `rotationType`.
---@field length integer (Read-only) The length of this entity on the Z axis, in grid units. This taken from entity's LocType config after being rotated by `rotationType`.
---@field isHidden boolean (Read-only) Whether this entity has been hidden by game logic.
---@field isRoofRemoved boolean (Read-only) Whether this entity has been hidden by the Remove Roof system.
---@field currentAnimation SeqType? (Read-only) The current animation being played by this entity. Returns `nil` if none is set.
---@field aabb AABB (Read-only) Returns the current bounding box for this `LocEntity`.

---Indicates the 90-degree rotation type a `LocEntity` is using. Also see LocEntity.rotationType.
---@enum RotationType
RotationType = {
    ZERO = 0,
    NINETY = 1,
    ONEEIGHTY = 2,
    TWOSEVENTY = 3,
}

---The name of one of the values, as `RotationType.FromID(RotationType.ZERO)` is `"ZERO"`.
---@param value integer
---@return string
---@diagnostic disable-next-line: inject-field
function RotationType.FromID(value) end
